      "q": "13. Integrate the expression, that is, $\\dfrac{{{\\text{e}}^{\\text{x}}}}{\\left( \\text{1+}{{\\text{e}}^{\\text{x}}} \\right)\\left( \\text{2+}{{\\text{e}}^{\\text{x}}} \\right)}$.",
