      "a": "$\\overrightarrow {{\\text{OP}}}\u00a0 = \\hat i + 2\\hat j - \\hat k$ and $\\overrightarrow {{\\text{OQ}}}\u00a0 =\u00a0 - \\hat i + \\hat j + \\hat k$\nThe position vector of ${\\text{R}}$ is $\\overrightarrow {{\\text{OR}}}\u00a0 = \\dfrac{{2( - \\hat i + \\hat j + \\hat k) + 1(\\hat i + 2\\hat j - \\hat k)}}{{2 + 1}} = \\dfrac{{( - 2\\hat i + 2\\hat j + 2\\hat k) + (\\hat i + 2\\hat j - \\hat k)}}{3}$\n$ = \\dfrac{{ - \\;\\hat i + 4\\hat j + \\hat k}}{3} =\u00a0 - \\dfrac{1}{3}\\hat i + \\dfrac{4}{3}\\hat j + \\dfrac{1}{3}\\hat k$\nii. Externally.\nAns:\nThe position vector of $R$ is $\\overrightarrow {{\\text{OR}}}\u00a0 = \\dfrac{{2( - \\hat i + \\hat j + \\hat k) - 1(\\hat i + 2\\hat j - \\hat k)}}{{2 - 1}} = ( - 2\\hat i + 2\\hat j + 2\\hat k) - (\\hat i + 2\\hat j - \\hat k)$\n$ =\u00a0 - 3\\hat i + 3\\hat k$"
